# Committed defaults — safe for any machine. Personal values belong in
# apps/desktop/.env.local (gitignored), which overrides this file.
#
# Orchestra needs no backend configuration: the desktop app runs its own local
# server for the phone, published through Tailscale Serve. See
# infra/tailscale/README.md.

# Notification summaries and webhook filters use a cheap model via OpenRouter.
# Set the key in the app (Settings → OpenRouter); without one those features
# fall back to heuristics. These .env files are build-time only — runtime
# settings live in the app.

# Only needed to ship signed releases from your own GitHub repo.
# MAIN_VITE_UPDATER_GH_TOKEN=
